        "seg_cer": 0.05,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "穿过城庄往山上走，就是我们要前往的石城西门。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 46.743,
      "end": 49.894,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "好，我们大概走了五六分钟山路，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0136,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "好，我们大概走了五六分钟山路。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 50.058,
      "end": 53.948,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "呃，不算陡，很平坦，而且一路走起好凉快，",
      "score": 0.0286,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0332,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.062,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "呃，不算陡，很平缓，而且一路走起好凉快。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 54.069,
      "end": 57.416,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "树荫又多。那么前面呢，就遇到一个",
      "score": 0.222,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1947,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.046,
