        "phon_examples": "荫/赢",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "输赢又多。那么在前面呢，就遇到一个。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 57.713,
      "end": 60.761,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "啊石门了。我先问一下廖老师，",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -2.072,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.667,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "啊，师傅们呐，我写班长廖老师。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 60.761,
      "end": 64.457,
      "label": "uncertain",
      "text": "廖老师，这个门，我们这个石头寨里有几个？",
      "score": 0.4092,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.8741,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.402,
        "seg_cer": 0.353,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "噻",
        "text_free": "你好噻，这个门在我们这个石头寨，这个有几个。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 64.708,
      "end": 68.108,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这个经过我们这个古石城呢，",
      "score": 0.68,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -2.5453,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.583,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个，嗯，整个我们这个峡谷事情呢。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 68.323,
      "end": 71.61,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "就有二十四个小门，二十四个小门啊，这么多。",
      "score": 0.0639,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1545,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.025,
        "seg_cer": 0.111,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "就有二十四个小门，二十四个小门，这么多啊！"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 71.61,
      "end": 74.662,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "嗯，这个门子还是什么门呢？这个呢，就是西门。",
      "score": 0.1846,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.411,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.16,
        "seg_cer": 0.222,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "那这个门是还是什么门呢？这个呢，还是叫西门。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 74.945,
      "end": 78.678,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "哦，那意思讲还有东门了，还有东门，还有",
      "score": 0.0686,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0068,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.062,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "咯",
        "text_free": "哦，那意思讲还有东门咯，还有东门，还有。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 78.72,
      "end": 83.268,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "南门，也还有。嗯。他有这个门都是一直修到山上去的吧？",
      "score": 0.219,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6053,
